### 4. WHAT LLM/API IS USED AND WHERE API CALLS ARE MADE

**API Provider:** Anthropic (Claude models via authenticated proxy)

**API Endpoint:** `<ZEO_BASE_URL>/api/llm/messages`

**Models Supported:**
- `claude-opus-4-7` (default)
- `claude-opus-4-6` (fallback)
- `claude-sonnet-4-6` (alternative)

**API Client (agent_llm_client.cpp:168-424):**

```cpp
void* LLM_REQUEST_THREAD::Entry()
{
    // 1. Initialize curl
    CURL* curl = curl_easy_init();

    // 2. Map display name to API model ID
    std::string apiModel = "claude-opus-4-7";
    if( m_model == "Claude 4.6 Opus" )
        apiModel = "claude-opus-4-6";
    else if( m_model == "Claude 4.6 Sonnet" )
        apiModel = "claude-sonnet-4-6";

    // 3. Build request body
    json requestBody;
    requestBody["model"] = apiModel;
    requestBody["messages"] = m_messages;
    requestBody["stream"] = true;
    requestBody["max_tokens"] = (apiModel.find("claude-opus") == 0) ? 128000 : 131072;

    // 4. Add tools (native tool_use)
    if( !m_tools.empty() )
    {
        requestBody["tools"] = json::array();
        for( const auto& tool : m_tools )
        {
            json toolObj;
            toolObj["name"] = tool.name;
            toolObj["description"] = tool.description;
            toolObj["input_schema"] = tool.input_schema;
            if( tool.defer_loading )
                toolObj["defer_loading"] = true;
            requestBody["tools"].push_back( toolObj );
        }
    }

    // 5. Add system prompt and metadata
    json metadataObj = {
        { "agent_mode", (m_agentMode == AgentMode::PLAN) ? "plan" : "execute" }
    };
    if( !m_systemPrompt.empty() )
        metadataObj["system_prompt"] = m_systemPrompt;
    // ... conversation metadata, tool durations ...
    requestBody["metadata"] = metadataObj;

    // 6. Set up curl with authentication
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_URL, ZEO_API_URL.c_str() );
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_POST, 1L );
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, requestBody.dump().c_str() );

    // 7. Add Bearer token from auth manager
    std::string accessToken = m_client->m_auth->GetAccessToken();
    curl_slist* headers = nullptr;
    headers = curl_slist_append( headers, "Content-Type: application/json" );
    headers = curl_slist_append( headers, 
        ("Authorization: Bearer " + accessToken).c_str() );
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, headers );

    // 8. Stream SSE response with callbacks
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_WRITEFUNCTION, StreamWriteCallback );
    curl_easy_setopt( curl, CURLOPT_WRITEDATA, &ctx );

    // 9. Perform request with retry logic (exponential backoff on transient errors)
    res = curl_easy_perform( curl );

    // 10. Clean up
    curl_easy_cleanup( curl );
    curl_slist_free_all( headers );
}
```

**Request Metadata Sent to Proxy (agent_llm_client.cpp:202-232):**

```cpp
