**Authentication:**
- Uses **Supabase** for user identity management
- Token stored in system keychain (macOS/Windows)
- Token sent in HTTP `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
- Proxy validates token and forwards request to Anthropic API

---

### 5. OVERALL CONTROL FLOW: USER MESSAGE → AGENT ACTIONS

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ USER SENDS MESSAGE (agent_frame.cpp:1854-1880)                  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  1. User types message in chat UI and presses Send              │
│  2. OnChatInputSubmitted() → m_chatController->SendMessage()    │
│  3. Message added to m_chatHistory with role:"user"             │
└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
                 ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ LLM REQUEST (chat_controller.cpp:SendMessage)                   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  4. Gather tools available for current editor state:            │
│     - If schematic open: include SCHEMATIC group tools          │
│     - If PCB open: include PCB group tools                      │
│     - Always include GENERAL group tools                        │
│                                                                  │
│  5. Build request:                                              │
│     - Model: "claude-opus-4-7" (default)                        │
│     - System prompt: core.md + agent.md + (plan.md if PLAN)    │
│     - Messages: full chat history                               │
│     - Tools: available tool schemas with input_schema           │
│                                                                  │
│  6. Call m_llmClient->AskStreamWithToolsAsync( messages,        │
│     tools, handler )                                             │
└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
                 ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ CURL STREAMING (agent_llm_client.cpp:Entry)                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  7. Background thread created (LLM_REQUEST_THREAD)              │
│  8. POST to https://<ZEO_BASE_URL>/api/llm/messages            │
│     - Header: Authorization: Bearer <Supabase token>           │
│     - Body: { model, messages, stream:true, max_tokens, tools,  │
│              metadata: { agent_mode, system_prompt, ... } }    │
│  9. Proxy validates token, forwards to Anthropic API           │
│ 10. Stream SSE response (Server-Sent Events)                    │
│     - Line 1: event: content_block_start                       │
│     - Line 2: data: {"type":"text",...}                        │
│     - Increment for text content or tool_use.input             │
│     - Line N: event: content_block_stop                        │
│     - Empty line \n\n marks end of event                       │
└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
                 ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ PARSE STREAMING CHUNKS (agent_llm_client.cpp:StreamWriteCallback)
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 11. For each \n\n-delimited SSE event:                          │
│     - Extract event type (content_block_start, delta, stop)    │
│     - Extract data (JSON payload)                               │
│     - If type:"tool_use": accumulate id, name, input            │
│     - Post wxThreadEvent (EVT_LLM_STREAM_CHUNK) to main thread │
│                                                                  │
│ 12. EVT_LLM_STREAM_CHUNK carries:                               │
│     LLM_EVENT_TYPE type (TEXT, TOOL_USE, TOOL_USE_DONE, etc.)  │
│     std::string text                                             │
│     std::string tool_use_id, tool_name                          │
│     nlohmann::json tool_input                                   │
└────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
                 ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ MAIN THREAD RECEIVES CHUNKS (agent_frame.cpp:OnLLMStreamChunk)  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 13. OnLLMStreamChunk( wxThreadEvent ) fires in main thread      │
│ 14. m_chatController->HandleStreamChunk( event )                │
│     - Accumulates text into response                            │
│     - On TOOL_USE events: creates PendingToolCall               │
│     - On TOOL_USE_DONE: emits EVT_CHAT_TOOL_READY               │
