### Summary Table

| Aspect | Implementation |
|--------|-----------------|
| **Core Location** | `/Users/gmp/workspaces/zeodotdev/zeo/src/zeo/agent/` |
| **System Prompts** | `prompts/core.md`, `prompts/agent.md`, `prompts/plan.md` |
| **Tool Definitions** | `tools/tool_manifest.json` (JSON schema single source of truth) |
