| **Models** | `claude-opus-4-7`, `claude-opus-4-6`, `claude-sonnet-4-6` |
| **Tool Execution** | Python scripts embedded in C++ (IPC to editors via protobuf) |
| **Async Pattern** | wxThread background streaming + event posts to main loop |

